      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Developing Advanced Automation with Red&amp;#160;Hat Ansible Automation Platform (AU374) is designed for automation content developers to use container-focused tools from Red&amp;#160;Hat Ansible Automation Platform to efficiently develop automation that can be managed by the automation controller.</rdf:li>
